<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Care headline yr share rises, no div.</title>
<headline>Care headline yr share rises, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Feb 28</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		2.2	   vs  0.5</p>
<p>    - attrib loss	   74.7	  vs  72.2 profit</p>
<p>    Attrib loss	     11.95	 vs  7.21 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.62	  vs  0.12</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.27	  vs  0.07</p>
<p>    Interest received     1.46	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.09	  vs  0.44</p>
<p>    Turnover		  2.98	  vs  0.88</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     12.30	 vs  7.16</p>
<p>Full name: Managed Care S.A. Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it had acknowledged the need to diversify and expand its operations to include other facets of Managed Health Care services. It said it was continuously pursuing suitable opportunities.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
